Of course it's not correct that levitation is needed for Medusa.
Besides water walking, or the more exotic choice of using amulet
of magical breathing, I use the scrolls of earth (from Sokoban) in
most cases to pass the sea of Medusa. More options are; to freeze
the water with wands of cold or an appropriate horn (or let some
monsters do that for you) - but it's risky if some fire is around.
And the levels are designed to be able to jump from island to
island. That all just off the top of my head - I am sure there are
some more options existing.

>    Levitation is a necessity and ring is the preferred source. So I
